---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Legal Disclosures & Privacy Policy"
  description="Official legal disclosures, sole proprietorship status, registered business scope, and data privacy framework for AYEGROUPE."
  lang="en"
  canonicalPath="/en/mentions-legales"
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F4F6F9] via-white to-white py-16 lg:py-20 text-[#0C2340] border-b border-slate-200/80">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-50 text-[#00A859] border border-emerald-200 font-mono mb-4">
        Statutory & Governance Disclosures
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4 text-[#0C2340]">
        Legal Disclosures & Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[#2C3E50] text-sm sm:text-base">
        Mandatory statutory disclosures governing site publication, operational entity status, and data protection compliance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white text-[#2C3E50]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0C2340] mb-3">1. Publisher Identification</h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3E50]">
          This website (accessible at <code class="text-[#0C2340] bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200 font-mono text-xs">https://ayegroupe.com</code>) is published by:<br/>
          <strong class="text-[#0C2340]">AYEGROUPE</strong> — sole proprietorship registered in British Columbia, Canada.<br/>
          <strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Business Number</strong>: 755620978BC0001<br/>
          <strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Registered Address</strong>: 14018 82 Ave, Surrey, British Columbia, Canada.<br/>
          <strong class="text-[#0C2340]">West Africa Regional Hub</strong>: Lomé, Republic of Togo.<br/>
          <strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Email</strong>: <a href="mailto:ayegroupe@ayegroupe.com" class="text-[#00A859] font-semibold hover:underline">ayegroupe@ayegroupe.com</a><br/>
          <strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Phone / WhatsApp (Canada)</strong>: +1 778 809 1060<br/>
          <strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Phone / WhatsApp (Togo)</strong>: +228 90 11 67 44
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0C2340] mb-3">2. Scope of Activities</h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3E50]">
          AYEGROUPE operates across two strategic divisions:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 mt-3 text-[#2C3E50]">
          <li><strong class="text-[#0C2340]">IT & Software Engineering</strong>: Custom software development, enterprise architecture consulting, systems integration, computer facilities management, and deployment of proprietary SaaS solutions (including <a href="https://www.ayeprep.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#00A859] font-semibold hover:underline">AyePrep</a> and <a href="https://www.ayejob.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#00A859] font-semibold hover:underline">AyeJob</a>).</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Togo Regional Hub</strong>: General Trade import and export, IT and office hardware distribution, office furniture, freight logistics, warehousing, and corporate vehicle fleet leasing in Lomé.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">
          A detailed breakdown of our 38 areas of expertise is available in the interactive accordion on our homepage and IT services page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0C2340] mb-3">3. Cloud Hosting Infrastructure</h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3E50]">
          This digital portal is hosted on secure, high-availability global edge infrastructure provided by Vercel Inc. (440 N Barranca Ave #4133, Covina, CA 91723, USA), utilizing multi-zone redundancy and automated DDoS mitigation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0C2340] mb-3">4. Data Privacy & Confidentiality Standards</h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3E50]">
          AYEGROUPE enforces strict principles of data minimization and protection:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 mt-3 text-[#2C3E50]">
          <li><strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Purpose Limitation</strong>: Any information submitted via our direct communication forms (name, company, email, phone, project outline) is solely utilized to address your direct inquiry.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Zero Commercial Disclosures</strong>: No personal information is ever sold, leased, or distributed to advertising brokers.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Encrypted Transport</strong>: All traffic is securely transmitted utilizing standard HTTPS (TLS 1.3) cryptographic protocols.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#0C2340]">User Rights</strong>: You maintain the right to review, rectify, or request deletion of any information held on file by contacting <code class="text-[#0C2340] bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-xs">ayegroupe@ayegroupe.com</code>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0C2340] mb-3">5. Cookies & Analytics</h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3E50]">
          This website uses two audience measurement tools, and no advertising trackers whatsoever:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 mt-3 text-[#2C3E50]">
          <li><strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Vercel Web Analytics</strong>: aggregated, anonymous traffic measurement, <strong class="text-[#0C2340]">cookie-free</strong> and without any persistent identifier. No consent is required and no data can identify you.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Google Analytics 4</strong>: detailed traffic statistics with IP anonymisation enabled. This tool sets cookies and is <strong class="text-[#0C2340]">only activated after your explicit consent</strong> through the banner shown on your first visit.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#0C2340]">Changing your choice</strong>: your decision is stored locally in your browser. To revoke it, clear this site's data in your browser and the banner will reappear.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0C2340] mb-3">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-[#2C3E50]">
          All trademarks, vector emblems, brand guidelines, editorial content, and interface designs contained within this portal are the intellectual property of AYEGROUPE. Any unauthorized reproduction or public redistribution without express written consent is strictly prohibited. The brands <em>AyePrep</em> and <em>AyeJob</em> are proprietary assets operated by the group.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
